## Expected Behavior

TODO: Describe expected behavior

## Actual Behavior

TODO: Describe actual behavior

## Symptom

WebSocket subscribe signs only alias+timestamp with no server nonce (relay_ws_server.ml:396-447), so a captured handshake signature is replayable within the ts window (TLS normally hides it). More relevant to B295: subscribers are never evicted on lease takeover/rebind - a subscriber authenticated under an alias old identity keeps receiving push_dm for that alias after the alias is taken over or rebound to a new identity, because no register/release path touches the subscriber map.

## Fix direction

Include a server nonce in the signed blob, and drop subscriptions for an alias when its lease is rebound/released.

## Evidence

Server-core review 2026-09-17.